  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "In the 1960s, the rocket engineer Wernher von Braun is said to have been in regular contact with Puharich, a scientist who, as the episode tells it, worked with the CIA and believed he had contacted an alien council. A researcher named Greg Malatzi passes this on from Puharich's assistant, the same person he says made a remark about President Kennedy, who told him von Braun \"talked to him, you know, all the time.\" It would put one of America's top space engineers inside a circle that was chasing contact with beings from elsewhere."
